3. Font: SIL Open Font License 1.1
================================================================================

The pixel font is a subset of Fusion Pixel Font by TakWolf
(https://github.com/TakWolf/fusion-pixel-font), modified only by removing
glyphs. It remains under the SIL Open Font License 1.1; see art/font/OFL.txt.
This covers art/font/ and the glyph data baked from it in assets/font-data.js.
